  "description": {
   "en": "A collection of stories: \n1. Josou Shounen no Susume\n2. Yotsuyu ni Ayanasu Hane\n3. Pulirula\n4. Shiro to Kuro\n5. Zutto Night (ずっとナイト)\n6. Zutto Night 2 (ずっとナイト2)\n7. Koisuru Futari to Ojou-sama\n8. Warui Ko ni Nareruyo\nSouichirou is in a fluffy relationship with his homeroom teacher. When, one day, he gets caught for bringing a cell phone to school and to make it worse he refuses to tell the reason. As a teacher, it's up to Kazuyoshi must teach him a lesson in discipline and love?\n9. Ponpoko (ぽんぽこ)"
